# 10. VPN

VPN stands for Virtual Private Network.

A VPN creates a secure connection over an untrusted network such as the Internet.

It can allow a remote employee to securely access company resources.

### Example

```text
Remote User
     ↓
Internet
     ↓
VPN
     ↓
Company Network
     ↓
Internal Resource
```

### VPN Troubleshooting

1. Check Internet connectivity.
2. Check VPN client.
3. Check credentials.
4. Check MFA.
5. Verify VPN connection.
6. Test internal resources.
7. Document or escalate.

