# 13. Security Group vs Distribution Group

## Security Group

A security group is primarily used to assign permissions and control access to resources.

Example:

```text
Finance Security Group
        ↓
Finance Shared Folder
        ↓
Access Permission
```

## Distribution Group

A distribution group is primarily used to distribute email messages to multiple recipients.

Example:

```text
HR Distribution Group
        ↓
HR Employees
        ↓
Email Distribution
```

### Key Difference

```text
Security Group
→ Access and permissions

Distribution Group
→ Email distribution
```

