# 17. Microsoft 365 Remote User Troubleshooting

### Scenario

A remote employee cannot access a company application.

### Initial Questions

* When did the issue start?
* Did you make any changes?
* Is your Internet working?
* Can you access other websites?
* Can other users access the application?
* Is the VPN connected?
* Are you receiving an error?
* Did you recently change your password?
* Is MFA working?

### Troubleshooting Process

```text
Internet
↓
VPN
↓
Authentication
↓
MFA
↓
Microsoft 365 / Entra ID
↓
Application
↓
Permissions
↓
Verification
```

If a permission issue is identified, changes should only be made when properly authorized.

