# 18. Help Desk Troubleshooting Methodology

The troubleshooting methodology practiced today:

```text
1. Gather information
2. Understand the symptoms
3. Ask targeted questions
4. Identify possible causes
5. Start with basic troubleshooting
6. Apply an authorized fix
7. Verify the result
8. Document the work
9. Close or escalate
```

This methodology can be applied across:

* Windows
* Linux
* Networking
* Active Directory
* Microsoft 365
* Security

